<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP LATEST - FRANCE SWEDEN LEVEL IN DECIDING GAME.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP LATEST - FRANCE SWEDEN LEVEL IN DECIDING GAME.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest score from the</p>
<p>deciding second reverse singles in the Davis Cup tennis final</p>
<p>between Sweden and France on Sunday:</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) took the first set 7-6 against</p>
<p>Nicklas Kulti (Sweden). Kulti won the second set 6-2 to square</p>
<p>the match.</p>
<p>Earlier result: Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Cedric Pioline</p>
<p>(France) 3-6 6-7 (8-10) 6-4 6-4 9-7</p>
<p>Sweden and France level 2-2.</p>
</text>
